# Clinic — local development

**Inherits:** monorepo root `.cursor/rules/`. Port **3203** — `npm run dev`.

Prisma: `prisma/schema.prisma`. Services: `src/lib/services/`.

**Env:** `DATABASE_URL`, `CONTROL_PLANE_URL` / `ORCHESTRATOR_EVENT_URL` (`http://127.0.0.1:4000` on host), `CONTROL_PLANE_SERVICE_TOKEN`, `SATELLITE_EVENT_SERVICE_TOKEN`, `ERA_SSO_SHARED_SECRET`. Do not set `ERA_SATELLITE_ORGANIZATION_ID=demo-org` — org bind comes from Sync/DB.

**i18n:** `messages/{az,ru,en}.json` + `@era/i18n-common`.

**Auth:** local `POST /api/auth/login`; management SSO `/api/auth/sso/exchange`.
